Tectonic v{version}

  1) example  Example
  2) None, only add it to the repository
Which image is this for? [1-2, 0 for none]: 2

  1) upstream/base-image/collected  A base only the collection knows about
  2) upstream/base-image/fedora  Fedora, as this collection describes it
  3) community/browser  A browser, from the second collection (requires flatpak)
  4) upstream/browser  A browser, from the first collection
  5) upstream/custom-kernel  A kernel the image pins, swapped in over the base's own
  6) upstream/debian-family  apt and its state directories, which every deb build layer reaches for
  7) upstream/fedora-family  dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for
  8) upstream/flatpak  Flatpak client and a daily update timer
  9) upstream/needs-family  A component that needs the family adapter under it (requires build-environment)
  10) upstream/signature-policy  Sigstore signature verification for the image's own updates
Which components? [1-10, several, 0 for none]: 4

Track upstream for `browser`? (Yes/No)
